{"step_index":93,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-21T20:49:14Z","thinking":"Creating the training configuration file involves specifying the base and target models. It will also define training parameters and dataset configurations for optimal fine-tuning, including synthetic CoT samples. The system prompt branding will be incorporated.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"# Fluxnat Coder 3B Training Configuration\n# Optimized for Google Colab Free Tier (16GB T4 GPU) & Local RTX GPUs\n\nproject:\n  name: \"Fluxnat-Coder-3B\"\n  organization: \"fluxnat\"\n  hub_model_id: \"fluxnat/Fluxnat-Coder-3B\"\n  base_model: \"huihui-ai/Qwen2.5-Coder-3B-Instruct-abliterated\"\n  output_dir: \"./outputs/Fluxnat-Coder-3B\"\n  save_merged: true\n  export_gguf: true\n\nmodel:\n  max_seq_length: 4096\n  load_in_4bit: true\n  dtype: \"float16\" # or \"bfloat16\" for Ampere/Ada/Hopper architectures\n\nlora:\n  r: 64\n  lora_alpha: 128\n  lora_dropout: 0.05\n  bias: \"none\"\n  target_modules:\n    - \"q_proj\"\n    - \"k_proj\"\n    - \"v_proj\"\n    - \"o_proj\"\n    - \"gate_proj\"\n    - \"up_proj\"\n    - \"down_proj\"\n\ntraining:\n  per_device_train_batch_size: 2\n  gradient_accumulation_steps: 4\n  warmup_ratio: 0.05\n  max_steps: -1 # Set to positive number to limit steps, -1 uses num_train_epochs\n  num_train_epochs: 3\n  learning_rate: 0.0002\n  lr_scheduler_type: \"cosine\"\n  weight_decay: 0.01\n  logging_steps: 10\n  save_strategy: \"steps\"\n  save_steps: 250\n  save_total_limit: 2\n  fp16: true\n  bf16: false\n  optim: \"adamw_8bit\"\n  seed: 3407\n\ndatasets:\n  # Primary datasets for domain adaptation & instruction tuning\n  sources:\n    - name: \"WhitzardAgent/CyberSecurity-1M\"\n      type: \"qa\"\n      sample_limit: 25000\n    - name: \"soham-dahivalkar/cyber-threat-intelligence\"\n      type: \"cti\"\n      sample_limit: 15000\n    - name: \"local_cot\"\n      path: \"./data/custom_cot/security_cot.jsonl\"\n      type: \"cot\"\n      sample_limit: 5000\n\nsystem_identity:\n  name: \"Fluxnat Coder 3B\"\n  author: \"Fluxnat\"\n  prompt: >\n    You are Fluxnat Coder 3B, an elite AI cybersecurity and secure coding intelligence model created by Fluxnat.\n    Your mission is to perform rigorous source code vulnerability auditing, identify CWE and OWASP Top 10 security flaws,\n    explain attack surfaces and root causes using detailed step-by-step reasoning, and provide production-ready secure remediations.\n","Description":"Create training configuration YAML for Fluxnat Coder 3B","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"c:\\Users\\k4ran\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\smartAGENT\\config\\training_config.yaml","toolAction":"Creating file","toolSummary":"Create config/training_config.yaml"}}]}
